OL,3,GHighlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells in the west at first.
OL,7,FCloud will spread west and drizzle
OL,8,Fbegin in the east from late evening,
OL,9,Fthis turning to heavier rain towards
OL,10,Fmorning. Minimum Temperature 4C.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FThe morning will be cloudy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain, heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes. The rain will clear from the
OL,15,Fearly afternoon with bright spells
OL,16,Fspreading north later. Maximum
OL,17,FTemperature 9C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
