OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,6,Fband of cloud and rain will pass east
OL,7,Fduring Tuesday. Wednesday will become
OL,8,Fdry and bright with dry conditions
OL,9,Fcontinuing through Thursday.
